  "content": "<section>\n<section>\n<div>\n<p>這個模組是 GameStage 模組和 Appleskin 模組的擴充套件。</p>\n<p>您將能夠使用 CraftTweaker 腳本來設定 Appleskin 模組的疊加顯示階段。</p>\n<p>在解鎖階段之前，飢餓條和生命條將保持原版樣式。</p>\n<p>解鎖後，Appleskin 模組的所有提示資訊和詳細數據都將可見。</p>\n<p>依賴項目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a> 由 squeek502 開發</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker</a> 由 Jareddlll08 開發</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/game-stages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GameStage</a> 由 DarkhaxDev 開發</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CraftTweaker 整合的 script.zs 範例：</p>\n<div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">\n<div><span style=\"color:#c586c0\">import</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#4ec9b0\">mods</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">.</span><span style=\"color:#4ec9b0\">appleskinstage</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">.</span><span style=\"color:#4ec9b0\">AppleskinStage</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">;</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#9cdcfe\">AppleskinStage</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">.</span><span style=\"color:#dcdcaa\">setStage</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">(</span><span style=\"color:#ce9178\">\"Demo_Stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">);</span></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎在您的模組包中使用本模組，並在評論區提問。</p>\n<p>標誌設計由 dxinxo 提供</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
